# PHASE 6 — RESQFLOW AI
# Autonomous Emergency Coordination & Multi-Agent Intelligence Network

## PROJECT

RESQFLOW AI — Autonomous Emergency Response & Supply Chain Intelligence Network

## MISSION

Transform the existing RESQFLOW AI platform into a unified, multi-agent emergency intelligence and coordination system.

Integrate Phase 3 emergency intelligence, Phase 4 inventory intelligence and Phase 5 logistics into one AI-powered coordination layer.

The AI must understand a developing emergency, retrieve verified operational data, analyze its consequences, coordinate specialist agents, identify resource and logistics constraints, produce an actionable response plan, monitor changes, and recommend appropriate next actions to authorized human operators.

This must be implemented inside the existing project. Do not rebuild the application.

